{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X对人物心理动机和前后转折的解释有所压缩，尤其S06、S09、S13，Y更能让人明白他为什么想念、为什么犹豫，以及最后如何面对孤独。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点词突出，话与感受交替呈现，感受又按音乐节点出现，边听边扫更容易抓住每段核心，也更容易察觉情绪和音乐细节的微妙变化。Y的叙事解释更充分，人物动机和最终选择的来龙去脉更完整，但左右两栏同时承载大量信息，短时间内不容易兼顾。综合实际观看体验，我更愿意选X，尽管它牺牲了一部分叙事深度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "02532a37-0c6e-41b5-bf4c-5dbdd9764920", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T090826746635Z", "elapsed_seconds": 96.14, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:10:02.890701+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a2789e116bf97930e41f3e10d1d352944e83562b9343904e33f02da1a7913c7d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedf